;; (bor ty (slt ty x y) (sgt ty x y)) -> (ne ty x y)
function %test_bor_slt_sgt(i32, i32) -> i8 fast {
block0(v0: i32, v1: i32):
    v2 = icmp slt v0, v1
    v3 = icmp sgt v0, v1
    v4 = bor v2, v3
    return v4
}

; run: %test_bor_slt_sgt(1, 1) == 0
; run: %test_bor_slt_sgt(1, 3) == 1
; run: %test_bor_slt_sgt(3, 1) == 1

